---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /
title: "CalculateMoney — Free Financial Calculators for India (EMI, SIP, Tax & More)"
description: "Free, fast and accurate financial calculators for India — EMI, SIP, income tax (FY 2025-26), FD, PPF, FIRE, SWP and more. No sign-up, instant results, shareable links."
---
<div class="wrap">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Financial calculators that give you the real numbers</h1>
    <p>Free, accurate and built for India — from loan EMIs and SIP returns to the new-vs-old tax regime. No sign-up, no spreadsheets. Every calculator updates instantly and every calculation has a shareable link.</p>
  </section>

  {% set cats = [
    { name: "Loans", blurb: "Know the true cost of borrowing before you sign." },
    { name: "Investments", blurb: "Project SIPs, lumpsums and long-term compounding." },
    { name: "Deposits", blurb: "Bank-accurate maths for FDs, RDs and PPF." },
    { name: "Tax", blurb: "FY 2025-26 income tax and current GST rates." },
    { name: "Retirement", blurb: "Size your corpus and plan the withdrawal phase." },
    { name: "Planning", blurb: "See what inflation does to money over time." }
  ] %}

  {% for cat in cats %}
  <p class="cat-label">{{ cat.name }} — {{ cat.blurb }}</p>
  <div class="card-grid">
    {% for c in calcs %}{% if c.cat == cat.name %}
    <a class="calc-card" href="/{{ c.slug }}/">
      <span class="calc-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ c.icon }}</span>
      <span class="calc-card-name">{{ c.name }}</span>
      <span class="calc-card-short">{{ c.short }}</span>
    </a>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <p class="cat-label">Rupee value over time — built on actual recorded inflation</p>
  <div class="card-grid">
    <a class="calc-card" href="/historical-inflation-india/">
      <span class="calc-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">📊</span>
      <span class="calc-card-name">India inflation history</span>
      <span class="calc-card-short">Every year from {{ cpi.first }} to {{ cpi.latest }}, with decade averages and the full data table.</span>
    </a>
    {% for o in cpiYears %}
    <a class="calc-card" href="/rupee-value-in-{{ o.year }}/">
      <span class="calc-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">🕰️</span>
      <span class="calc-card-name">Rupee value in {{ o.year }}</span>
      <span class="calc-card-short">₹100 in {{ o.year }} is worth {{ 100 | cpiWorthInr(o.year) }} today.</span>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <p class="cat-label">Savings goals — how much to invest each month</p>
  <div class="card-grid">
    {% for g in sipGoals %}
    <a class="calc-card" href="/sip-for-{{ g.slug }}/">
      <span class="calc-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">🎯</span>
      <span class="calc-card-name">SIP for {{ g.label }}</span>
      <span class="calc-card-short">The monthly SIP needed to reach {{ g.label }}, for every tenure and return rate.</span>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <p class="cat-label">Home loan EMI by amount</p>
  <div class="card-grid">
    {% for l in loanAmounts %}
    <a class="calc-card" href="/emi-for-{{ l.slug }}-home-loan/">
      <span class="calc-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">🏠</span>
      <span class="calc-card-name">{{ l.label }} home loan EMI</span>
      <span class="calc-card-short">EMI, total interest and the salary needed for a {{ l.label }} loan.</span>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <section class="prose" style="margin-top:3rem;">
    <h2>Why CalculateMoney?</h2>
    <p><strong>Accurate methods, stated openly.</strong> Every calculator explains its formula and assumptions on the page — the FD calculator compounds quarterly like Indian banks do, the RD calculator computes per-instalment interest the way the post office does, and the income tax calculator applies the Section 87A rebate, surcharge and marginal relief exactly as the Finance Act 2025 prescribes.</p>
    <p><strong>Type or slide.</strong> Enter exact amounts like ₹4,83,250 or drag a slider to explore. Results, charts and year-by-year tables update instantly — and the link in your address bar always reproduces your exact calculation, so you can save or share it.</p>
    <p><strong>Free and private.</strong> No login, no personal data collected by the calculators — everything runs in your browser. These tools are for education and planning; for major decisions, verify with a qualified advisor.</p>
  </section>
</div>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebSite",
  "name": "{{ site.name }}",
  "url": "{{ site.url }}/",
  "description": {{ site.description | dump | safe }}
}
</script>
